Word, Excel, PowerPoint and Hangul (HWP/HWPX) documents are drawn and exported
to PDF by the application itself using these libraries and Electron's built-in
printer. No office suite is bundled or required.

The complete dependency tree, with per-package license text, is reproducible
from the lockfile in this repository.

